---
layout: page/layout
---

<section id="about" class="pt-0 lg:pt-6">

  <div id="portrait" class="fade-in-once">
    <div class="dialog">Hello, glad to see you here.</div>
    <a href="<%= url_for("image/about/artist_persona.png") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup data-caption="Artist Persona 2.0" class="fade-in-once-nodely">
      <img src="<%= url_for("image/about/1p.png") %>" alt="123">
    </a>

  </div>

  <div id="protile" class=" reveal-x">
    <!-- 名字 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start xl:items-end w-full mb-4 ">
      <div class="name">
        <h1>葬光</h1>
        <h2>After Light</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="note en">A faint light after sorrow has been buried</p>
    </div>
    <!-- 文字 -->
    <div class="content">
      <strong>▌About Me</strong><br>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Weird Aquarius. Pansexual.<br>
        A writer and casual trumpet player, occasionally draws illustrations, rarely composes music. Mostly focused on original works. Been into yuri since 2020. <br>
        A Christian who supports marriage equality. Okay with religion jokes, just don’t be an ass about it.
      </p><br>
      <strong>▌Preferences</strong><br>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Alan Rickman Mania. Long-time fan of Evanescence.<br>
        Silver fox and Mommy lover. 😭 I love strong-willed ladies. Yuri and strong female characters are my thing. Huge fan of age-gap relationships, especially student-teacher romance—strictly in fiction.<br><br>

        Mainly reading, then movies, manga and games. TV series and anime come last. Musou (Warriors) game enjoyer.<br>
        I like musicals, but I'm not an expert and haven't studied them in particular.

      </p><br>
      <strong>▌Bottom line</strong><br>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Arrogance, emotional manipulation, and disrespect toward my faith.<br>
        If you know my real name, please don’t call me that.<br><br>

        As for ships, I’m generally flexible but not into breaking established pairings. I usually stick to canon. I don’t really engage with self-insert content unless it’s from close friends—sorry.
      </p><br>
      <strong>▌Recently interested</strong><br>
      <div class="flex flex-row justify-between">
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-8">
          <p class="">
            Fiction:<br>
            • Earthsea<br>
            • Harry Potter<br>
          </p>
          <p class="">
            Musicals/plays:<br>
            • Sunset Boulevard<br>
            • Les Misérables<br>
            • Mozart, l'opéra rock<br>
            • Notre-Dame de Paris<br>
            • Harry Potter and the Cursed Child<br>
          </p>

        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-8">
          <p class="">
            Movies:<br>
            <span> • The Hours</span><br>
            • Kokuho(国宝) <br>
            • Hidden Figures
          </p>
          <p>
            Anime/Manga:<br>
            • EREMENTAR GERAD<br>
            • Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You<br>
            • Ristorante Paradiso<br>
            • Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D's
          </p>
          <p>
            Games:<br>
            • Path to Nowhere<br>
            • BOTW/TOTK/Hyrule Warriors: Age of Calamity<br>
            • Resident evil(up to 6)<br>
            • Samurai Warriors(up to 4-II)<br><br>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-4">
        For everything else, please see the <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_vSUnpHCl8-76645Bvrg0X58fnGprj3mkmcjI_RiDA0/edit?tab=t.eh4ysb1f9p8i#heading=h.wihktwfgnhue">list here</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="gallery flex flex-row xl:flex-col fade-in-once max-xl:col-span-2 mt-1 xl:mt-0">
    <div class="pic-group flex flex-col xl:flex-row flex-wrap mt-auto xl:mt-0 xl:ms-auto gap-2">
      <a href="<%= url_for("image/about/avatar.png") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup>
        <img class="" src="<%= url_for("image/about/avatar.png") %>" alt="Avatar 1">
      </a>
      <a href="<%= url_for("image/about/avatar-2.png") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup>
        <img class="" src="<%= url_for("image/about/avatar-2.png") %>" alt="">
      </a>
      <a href="<%= url_for("image/about/avatar-zokunya.png") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup data-caption="Illustrator：賊喵Zokunya">
        <img class="" src="<%= url_for("image/about/avatar-zokunya.png") %>" alt="">
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="chibi-gif ms-auto xl:mt-auto">
      <a href="<%= url_for("image/about/1.gif") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup class="chibi gif1">
        <img src="<%= url_for("image/about/1.gif") %>" alt="">
      </a>
      <a href="<%= url_for("image/about/2.gif") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup class="chibi gif2">
        <img src="<%= url_for("image/about/2.gif") %>" alt="">
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col-reverse xl:flex-col w-1/2 md:w-min">

      <a class="Q" href="<%= url_for("image/about/Q-mrerror.png") %>" data-fancybox="gallery" data-no-swup data-caption="Illustrator：哩哩">
        <img src="<%= url_for("image/about/Q-mrerror.png") %>" alt="">
      </a>
      <div class="w-fit md:w-full text-right">
        Illustrator：哩哩
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>